<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P rates Kreditanstalt fuer Wiederaufbau bond AAA.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Kreditanstalt fuer Wiederaufbau bond AAA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Friday that it had assigned its AAA rating to Germany's Kreditanstalt fuer Wiederaufbau's 30 billion yen worth of 5.4 percent dual currency bonds due May 19, 2000.</p>
<p>The credit rating agency said the rating outlook is stable.</p>
</text>
